        "original_id": "8ba9825a-07e9-58b9-950b-843f7254650d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: For Against, Aaroh\n- Albums: Echelons\n- Places: Lincoln, Nebraska; Karachi, Sindh, Pakistan; United States\n- Genres: post-punk, dream pop, alternative rock\n- Record Labels: Independent Project\n\nFacts:\n- For Against is a United States post-punk and dream pop band from Lincoln, Nebraska.\n- For Against was formed in 1984 and has produced material steadily from its inception to the present despite lineup changes and dormant periods.\n- Echelons is the debut studio album by American rock band For Against.\n- Echelons was released in 1987 by Independent Project.\n- Aaroh is an alternative rock band from Karachi, Sindh, Pakistan.\n- Aaroh was formed in 1998.",
